# TR House Telvanni: "Reclaiming Oathrung" (TR_m1_HT_Oathrung). Mistress Faruna's "chores" adds "Oathrung" (10): the
# Dwemer staff in Ember Keep's vault in Firewatch. Her manservant Tirele Edri explains it (11). Holding the staff
# logs 20 (TR_m1_Niv_JustASipDoor_Script on the vault door); Faruna takes it ("Yes, here it is." 1: 50).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel and the way into the vault. The staff's ref is 093651DE (TR_Mainland's
# slot 09).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_vaerin_q6_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_oathrung_start
run
player->PositionCell 7390 4400 16170 0 "Tel Oren, Tower"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Faruna"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Faruna
ask chores
ask Oathrung
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Oathrung == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 5844 4330 15360 0 "Tel Oren, Tower"
until 600 "TR_m1_Tirele_Edri"->GetDistance player < 1500
wait 60
talk TR_m1_Tirele_Edri
ask Oathrung
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Oathrung == 11
bye
end

case ht_oathrung_vault
run
player->PositionCell 3192 3860 3810 0 "Firewatch, Ember Keep: Treasure Chamber"
wait 150
take 093651DE
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Oathrung >= 20
end

case ht_oathrung_done
run
player->PositionCell 7390 4400 16170 0 "Tel Oren, Tower"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Faruna"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Faruna
ask Oathrung
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Oathrung == 50
bye
end
